<section class="block" id="faq">
  <h2>Good to know</h2>
  <div class="narrow">
    <details><summary>What is an excess?</summary><p>The part of a claim you pay yourself. A higher excess usually lowers your premium.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Will a glass claim affect my no-claim discount?</summary><p>On Plus and Max in this sample, mirror and glass claims leave your discount unchanged.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Can I change plan later?</summary><p>Yes. Changes apply from the next billing date.</p></details>
  </div>
</section>
